OL,3,AAI staff 'genuinely frightened' for
OL,4,Ahumanity's future, ex-Anthropic
OL,5,Aresearcher tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn artificial intelligence researcher
OL,8,Fwho quit AI firm Anthropic has told the
OL,9,FBBC that people working on the
OL,10,Ftechnology were "genuinely frightened"
OL,11,Fabout the speed of its advancements and
OL,12,Fwhat it could mean for humanity.
OL,14,FJacob Coxon told the BBC's Laura
OL,15,FKuenssberg on Saturday about his viral
OL,16,Fresignation post in which he raised
OL,17,Fconcerns about out-of-control AI.
OL,19,F"I believe that if we don't slow down
OL,20,Fat the current rate of progress, there
OL,21,Fis a strong chance that we could all
OL,22,Fdie in the immediate future," he said.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
