OL,3,AStudent loan terms to be made clearer
OL,4,Ain England
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity applicants in England will
OL,7,Fbe given clearer information about
OL,8,Fstudent loans before they take them
OL,9,Fout, the government has said.
OL,11,FMinisters said they would spell out
OL,12,Fthat governments can change repayment
OL,13,Frules and that different career choices
OL,14,Fcan affect how much borrowers repay.
OL,16,FThey agreed to some but not all of the
OL,17,Frecommendations made by MPs after an
OL,18,Finquiry into student loans, and did not
OL,19,Fsay whether they would reverse a freeze
OL,20,Fto the repayment threshold for some
OL,21,Fgraduates.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
